v {xschem version=3.4.8RC file_version=1.2}
G {}
K {type=primitive
format="@name @pinlist @model"
template="name=XVREF model=midref_b"
description="midrail_ref option C, biased: FVF class-AB VDD/2 buffer with its
IB from one pbias slave of the shared generator. Subcircuit midref_b of
/foss/designs/mixed_signal/ramp_gen/ref/midrail_ref/ref_fvf_biased.spice, reused by path
through .include. type=primitive: the subcircuit comes from that file, so
xschem netlists this line and never descends into a schematic. The drawing
of the inside is midref_b.sch in the same directory.
Pins in the subcircuit order: out pbias vdd vss."
}
V {}
S {}
E {}
L 4 -60 -40 60 -40 {}
L 4 60 -40 60 40 {}
L 4 60 40 -60 40 {}
